TITLE:: PV_HPinverse
summary:: Inverts spectral bins
categories:: UGens>FFT
related:: Classes/FFT, Classes/IFFT, Classes/PV_ChainUGen

DESCRIPTION::
Inverts or rearranges the bins of an FFT chain according to the plugin's algorithm. This UGen must be placed between FFT and IFFT.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new

ARGUMENT:: chain
A PV chain produced by FFT or another PV UGen.

ARGUMENT:: index
The inversion index or parameter used by the plugin.

RETURNS::
A PV chain.

EXAMPLES::

code::
(
{
    var source = WhiteNoise.ar(0.05);
    var chain = FFT(LocalBuf(2048), source);
    chain = PV_HPinverse(chain, 1);
    IFFT(chain) ! 2
}.play;
)
::
